        "lines": [
          "rx_frontend is a user SUBCIRCUIT: photodiode + TIA behind optical",
          "port `pin` and electrical port `vout`. U1 and U2 are two instances",
          "of the same definition — double-click one to descend into it (the",
          "breadcrumb takes you back up; Esc also ascends).",
          "U1 receives the pulsed path (LAS1 -> MOD1), U2 a plain CW laser.",
          "The probe popt inside the definition is measured once per instance",
          "and shows up as U1__popt / U2__popt beside the top-level vout1/vout2.",
          "",
          "Try: open U1, set TIA1.gain_ohm = 1000, ascend, Run — both",
          "receivers' output swings grow together (one shared definition)."
        ]
      }
